					"text": "tap.python.spike-q4-dispatch\n\nQ4 (M3): with a class-level anything, does 'steps 8' set the instance attribute or reach anything; does an instance method (object_addmethod: hello, int) win over anything; what reaches anything (float, bang, list, symbol, an unknown selector)? Then 'probe' asks object_getmethod() for names on the spike (which has anything) and on tap.python~ (which has none), against what each answers for a name no class has. 'who' and 'bang' are both class and instance methods: which answers? The bare spike has no instance attribute or methods: what reaches its anything?",
